  "changes": [
    "Original complete official Demo and its component, not a new visual skin. Original GLSL retained.",
    "System-font/light CSS tokens and original Tailwind utility compilation; no external fonts or image assets.",
    "Shared lifecycle boundary: WebGL compile/link checks, allocation tracking, context-loss failure, partial-init cleanup, visibility unmount/remount, stale RAF/timer guards, missing-root fallback.",
    "Zero-sized outer preview waits or disposes until sized. No fake fallback effect.",
    "Original fixtures are aesthetic UI; no actual AI service or account operation.",
    "Original CTA anchor href changed to local # and target omitted; capture handler prevents local navigation and states demo-only. Icons and marketing copy retained, no brand endorsement.",
    "Pinned Paper shaders/shaders-react0.0.72 each ship full MIT Copyright2024 Lost Coast Labs(Paper Design). This is evidence for these exact installed modules, not a claim about all current Paper products.",
    "Paper numeric-only ColorPanels: unused image-uniform loader removed, string/image uniforms explicitly rejected (no emptyPixel binary). Original numeric processing and shader equations retained. Init/update async paths have alive/error guards; reduced motion forces renderer speed0, static uniform/resize renders preserved.",
    "Actual emitted shader-utils contributes declarePI/colorBandingFix only. Its unreferenced simplexNoise is tree-shaken, not contained in ColorPanels fragment; no Ashima simplex implementation emitted in this scene."
  ],
